               MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.
               SET WS-ADDR-COMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.
               PERFORM CALL-ZRT01CPC-001.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-REG-NUMBER-0002.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-COLOUR-0003.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-TERM-0004.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-MAKE-0005.
               PERFORM CHECK-ROOF-TYPE-0006.
               PERFORM REFRESH-POSTCODE-0007.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-MANAGED-FUND-0008.
               PERFORM EXPAND-EQUITIES-0009.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-REG-NUMBER-0010.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-SUM-ASSURED-0011.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
